  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 11 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTucked away at the end of a peaceful cul-de-sac in sought-after Manly, this sunny north-facing home could be the opportunity you've been waiting for. Cute as a button and full of character this delightful little gem features beautiful white painted sarked ceilings adding charm and a lovely sense of light and space.\r\n\r\nThree double bedrooms, including a generous master flowing beautifully to the outdoors, offer more space than you might expect. The full-length deck is perfect for summer entertaining or watching the kids stroll through the park on their way to school. Peace, quiet, birdsong, park views, and a peep of sea add to the delicious Coast lifestyle vibe. Close to schools, college, shops, public transport, tennis club, bowling club, sailing club, Manly Park, and of course an array of beautiful beaches.\r\n\r\nNeat as a pin, easy-care, and vacant, this little gem offers seriously good buying potential and after more than 15 years of ownership our realistic vendors are now ready to sell. With auction day approaching secure your new Manly address at an affordable price and be settled in for Christmas.\r\n\r\nDon't sit on the picket fence with this one - the time to enquire is now.\r\n\r\nAttend our Open Homes or call for a private viewing.",
